<section class="hero hero-split">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Personal &amp; business budgeting</p>
    <h1>Know where it goes, <span class="grow">down to the last shilling</span>.</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">
      Cashflow is a simple budgeting and financial planning app. Follow every
      shilling in and out, scan receipts, set monthly budgets, and watch your
      savings goals close in.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="/auth/register" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Start for free</a>
      <a href="/auth/login" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">I already have an account</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-media">
    <img
      src="/img/landing/hero-shop-phone.jpg"
      srcset="/img/landing/hero-shop-phone-sm.jpg 600w, /img/landing/hero-shop-phone.jpg 1000w"
      sizes="(max-width: 780px) 92vw, 460px"
      width="1000" height="714"
      alt="A shopkeeper smiles while checking her phone at her market stall"
      class="hero-photo"
    />
    <div class="hero-callout">
      <strong>15</strong>
      <span>currencies, converted at the live rate</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature-list">
  <div class="feature-row">
    <span class="feature-list-icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M6 2.5h12v18.3l-2.4-1.4-1.9 1.4-1.9-1.4-1.9 1.4-1.9-1.4-1.9 1.4-2.1-1.4V2.5Z"/>
        <path d="M9 8h6M9 11.5h6M9 15h3.5"/>
      </svg>
    </span>
    <div>
      <h3>Scan receipts</h3>
      <p>Snap a photo — Cashflow reads it, fills in the amount, and picks the category for you.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-row">
    <span class="feature-list-icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M3 20.5h18"/>
        <path d="M6 20.5v-7M12 20.5V6M18 20.5v-4.5"/>
      </svg>
    </span>
    <div>
      <h3>Monthly budgets</h3>
      <p>Set a limit per category and see exactly how much month is left in your money.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-row">
    <span class="feature-list-icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M6.5 10a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 11 0c0 4.2 1.4 5.7 2 6.3H4.5c.6-.6 2-2.1 2-6.3Z"/>
        <path d="M10.3 19a1.9 1.9 0 0 0 3.4 0"/>
      </svg>
    </span>
    <div>
      <h3>Smart alerts</h3>
      <p>Get warned before you blow a budget — with the projected damage and what it means for your goals.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-row">
    <span class="feature-list-icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.2"/>
        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4.6"/>
        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
      </svg>
    </span>
    <div>
      <h3>Savings goals</h3>
      <p>Plan for the big things — an emergency fund, a trip, a laptop — and close in on them.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="visual-break">
  <div class="visual-break-media">
    <img
      src="/img/landing/feature-savings.jpg"
      width="760" height="507"
      loading="lazy"
      alt="Coins and a growing plant inside a glass jar"
      class="visual-break-photo"
    />
  </div>
  <div class="visual-break-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Savings goals</p>
    <h2>Watch your goals get closer, not just further away.</h2>
    <p class="muted">
      Every contribution moves a real shilling out of a real wallet and into
      the goal it's meant for — no guessing whether the money you "saved" is
      still sitting in your spending account.
    </p>
    <a href="/auth/register" class="btn btn-primary">Set your first goal</a>
  </div>
</section>

<h2 class="section-title">How it works</h2>
<p class="section-sub">Three steps to healthier money habits.</p>
<section class="steps-grid">
  <div class="card step-card">
    <span class="step-num">1</span>
    <h3>Record as you spend</h3>
    <p class="muted">Log expenses in seconds or just photograph the receipt — every shilling lands in the right category.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card step-card">
    <span class="step-num">2</span>
    <h3>Set your limits</h3>
    <p class="muted">Give each category a monthly budget. Cashflow tracks your pace and warns you before you overshoot.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card step-card">
    <span class="step-num">3</span>
    <h3>See it add up</h3>
    <p class="muted">Insights, trends, and savings goals show your progress — and what your habits cost you per year.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="business-banner">
  <div class="business-banner-media">
    <img
      src="/img/landing/business-banner.jpg"
      width="1000" height="667"
      loading="lazy"
      alt="A food vendor checks his phone while running his stall"
      class="business-banner-photo"
    />
  </div>
  <div class="business-banner-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">For business owners</p>
    <h2>The books, the stock, and the tax — handled in the same place.</h2>
    <p>
      Sign up as a business and Cashflow opens a full set of books alongside
      your personal budget: sales, invoices, payroll, stock, and an
      accountant that reviews it all for you.
    </p>
    <a href="/auth/register" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Set up your business</a>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include("partials/footer") %>
